    "detailed_description": "Micro Abyss - action roguelike, in a subatomic procedurally generated universe. You, a descendant of an ancient deity, have to cleanse the Abyss from a rapidly spreading infection.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626160/extras/dbcbe9bc1aaaee9d6b22a57d3b2a7059.poster.avif?t=1660031007\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626160/extras/dbcbe9bc1aaaee9d6b22a57d3b2a7059.webm?t=1660031007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626160/extras/dbcbe9bc1aaaee9d6b22a57d3b2a7059.mp4?t=1660031007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Key features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Plunge into the atmosphere of a doomed world, which is about to be struck by an infection.<br></li><li>Learn the touching story of a disastrous threat.<br></li><li>Go through the evolutionary path from a frail child to the destroyer of any enemy.<br></li><li>Find all the friends in the Abyss, find out what they want and imbued with their stories.<br></li><li>Dynamic battles! Dodge shells, destroy enemies.<br></li><li>Open all genes, experiment with modifiers. Improve what you like.</li></ul>",
